1
00:00:00,256 --> 00:00:02,426
(Sheldon:)...is well established
in heroic mythology.

2
00:00:02,591 --> 00:00:05,511
(Sheldon:)Lot and his wife, Perseus and Medusa...

3
00:00:05,678 --> 00:00:07,348
(Sheldon:)-...Orpheus and Eurydice--
-Great.

4
00:00:07,513 --> 00:00:09,973
(Sheldon:)They always look. It never ends well.

5
00:00:10,474 --> 00:00:12,764
(Penny:)You gotta help me
get my arm into the sleeve.

6
00:00:12,935 --> 00:00:14,315
(Raj:)Okay.

7
00:00:17,857 --> 00:00:19,527
(Penny:)Is that my arm?

8
00:00:22,528 --> 00:00:25,198
(Sheldon:)Doesn't feel like an arm.

9
00:00:26,323 --> 00:00:29,073
(Penny:)Then maybe you should let it go.

10
00:00:30,953 --> 00:00:33,293
Alrighty.

11
00:00:44,717 --> 00:00:48,007
(Leonard:)Stars are pretty, aren't they?

12
00:00:49,138 --> 00:00:51,558
(Howard:)Up above the world so high.

13
00:00:51,724 --> 00:00:55,104
(Howard:)Like little diamonds in the sky.

14
00:00:55,311 --> 00:00:58,021
(Raj:)That's beautiful, dude.

